### ✅ Full DTO Unpacking

```csharp
// Master lists for unfolded data
public List<PricingRuleDto> AllRules { get; set; } = new();
public List<WeightCostItemDto> AllWeights { get; set; } = new();
public List<ZoneServiceAreaDto> AllAreas { get; set; } = new();
